#: ../../tools/clinical_guidelines_tools.rst:32
#: b2b74696c6d64c48b0ea58d0e28782e9
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the DailyMed database for FDA Established "
"Pharmacologic Classes (EPC). Returns drug class names and NDF-RT codes "
"that categorize drugs by their mechanism of action or pharmacologic "
"effect. Use this to find drug classes for a specific therapeutic area "
"(e.g., 'antihypertensive', 'antibiotic', 'antineoplastic') or to look up "
"specific pharmacologic class codes. The drug class codes can be used to "
"search DailyMed\\_search\\_spls for all drugs in that class."
msgstr ""

