#: ../../tools/clinical_guidelines_tools.rst:131
#: c2b1fcfbaca94a0fb6adae760f64363d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all sections (chapters) of a specific MAGICapp "
"clinical guideline. Returns the structural organization of the guideline "
"including section headings, text content, section types, and hierarchical"
" ordering. Use this to understand the guideline's structure and find "
"specific clinical topics within a guideline. Sections contain the "
"narrative text while recommendations are accessed separately via "
"MAGICapp\\_get\\_recommendations."
msgstr ""

