msgid "**Name**: ``NCI_get_drug_by_name``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clinical_guidelines_tools.rst:228
#: 12f45ca07fe44fafbe320742e56a7044
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a cancer drug from the "
"NCI Drug Dictionary by its pretty-url-name (slug). Returns comprehensive "
"drug information including definition, aliases (brand names, chemical "
"names, code names, CAS registry numbers), NCI concept ID, and links to "
"drug information summaries. The pretty-url-name is a lowercase hyphenated"
" slug (e.g., 'pembrolizumab', 'tamoxifen-citrate', 'nivolumab'). You can "
"find drug names from NCIDrugDict\\_search results (prettyUrlName field)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clinical_guidelines_tools.rst:232
#: d4cc2f622351462fb75ea5bb1d6714b2
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string) (required) Pretty URL name (slug) of the drug "
"(e.g., 'pembrolizumab', 'tamoxifen-citrate', 'nivolumab', 'trastuzumab')"
msgstr ""

